<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chiquita, Sara cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chiquita, Sara cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette cut Chiquita Brands International Inc and Sara Lee Corp to market perform from buy due to price, a DLJ source said.</p>
<p>-- Firm also upgraded CPC International Inc to buy from market perform, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
